<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10158" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιμετα-λαμβάνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>assume in turn</i> or <i>in
				exchange,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόσωπον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.785c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν τόπον τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ascl.
					<u>Tact.</u>
					10.15
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥσπερ ἐκ κληρονομίας τὸ μῖσος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					16.3.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>receive back in return,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				p.65J.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Piet.</u>
				113
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>take</i> arguments <i>in reverse order,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				350
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Gramm.,
				<i>use</i> a form <i>in place of</i> another, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Adv.</u>
				130.14
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				154.22
			</span></i>, al.; also, <i>to be changed,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς . .</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					130.11
				</span></i>
			.</div>
